(1935785, 265485, 75713, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo... I like the distance to the birds, the reflections... and the wonderful colors... doesn''t quite do it for me as far as representing the challenge though</td>', 'I really like this photo... I like the distance to the birds, the reflections... and the wonderful colors... doesn''t quite do it for me as far as representing the challenge though', '2005-12-08 15:32:16.000000', NULL, 1),
