(1939732, 265485, 11518, '<td valign="top">Some compression artifacts on the birds...either from the JPG conversion or too much sharpening/contrast enhancement.</td>', 'Some compression artifacts on the birds...either from the JPG conversion or too much sharpening/contrast enhancement.', '2005-12-10 02:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939735, 264992, 11518, '<td valign="top">Good idea, moving the background furthr back would have enhanced the photo a lot and help get rid of the harsh shadow.</td>', 'Good idea, moving the background furthr back would have enhanced the photo a lot and help get rid of the harsh shadow.', '2005-12-10 02:43:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939906, 264802, 45961, '<td valign="top">Mmm, this is a beautiful picture. The morning mist and rays barely caressing the skin. I gave a 7 on this. Not because it''s bad or anything. There''s a certain mood lacking, but because of my lack of photography knowledge, I don''t know what''s missing to the show.<br/>I felt like if you could have worked a little more nature into the shot, I''d almost give it a 10. Very well taken shot though.</td>', 'Mmm, this is a beautiful picture. The morning mist and rays barely caressing the skin. I gave a 7 on this. Not because it''s bad or anything. There''s a certain mood lacking, but because of my lack of photography knowledge, I don''t know what''s missing to the show.I felt like if you could have worked a little more nature into the shot, I''d almost give it a 10. Very well taken shot though.', '2005-12-10 07:56:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939911, 265952, 45961, '<td valign="top">I''m scared for you in this shot. I''m afraid of oil, so if that popcorn actually POPS, I''d assume that oil would splatter too. I gave a 7 because there''s something lacking in the composition. The contrasts works great with the teflon (I''m assuming) pan. And if you could have taken out your reflection it might have turned out better. I''m not exactly sure though.</td>', 'I''m scared for you in this shot. I''m afraid of oil, so if that popcorn actually POPS, I''d assume that oil would splatter too. I gave a 7 because there''s something lacking in the composition. The contrasts works great with the teflon (I''m assuming) pan. And if you could have taken out your reflection it might have turned out better. I''m not exactly sure though.', '2005-12-10 07:59:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939913, 266102, 45961, '<td valign="top">I know advance editting isn''t allowed, but this shot would have turned out a lot better if just the beer had colour while the rest was desaturated. It''s definitely a good effort. I like it although I think you might have over saturated yellow a bit too much. It''s that or when you desaturated the yellow the egg yolks doesn''t look so great. I gave 6 on this.</td>', 'I know advance editting isn''t allowed, but this shot would have turned out a lot better if just the beer had colour while the rest was desaturated. It''s definitely a good effort. I like it although I think you might have over saturated yellow a bit too much. It''s that or when you desaturated the yellow the egg yolks doesn''t look so great. I gave 6 on this.', '2005-12-10 08:02:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939917, 264196, 45961, '<td valign="top">There''s a shot in the "Too Late" challenge that has a VERY similar looking dog. If it''s the same photographer, your dog is talented and so are you. This photo lacks focus though. There isn''t much going on for this shot, look more like a snap shot in the middle of the night, if you don''t mind me being blunt. I still thought it was a good shot none the less. There''s just something lacking in the composition so I gave this a 6.</td>', 'There''s a shot in the "Too Late" challenge that has a VERY similar looking dog. If it''s the same photographer, your dog is talented and so are you. This photo lacks focus though. There isn''t much going on for this shot, look more like a snap shot in the middle of the night, if you don''t mind me being blunt. I still thought it was a good shot none the less. There''s just something lacking in the composition so I gave this a 6.', '2005-12-10 08:05:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939922, 265122, 45961, '<td valign="top">I originally gave this a 6, but compared to the others I gave six, this certainly deserves more than that. I''m attracted to morning mist as well. The silhouette is working so unbelievably well in this shot. The minor ripple in the water, fantastic. Thank goodness it wasn''t placid water, I don''t think it would be as good. The desolated wintered trees in the background adds a very extra "wow" factor in this shot. So I''m changing this to a 9. It''s seriously a good shot. I hope you get a ribbon, I really do, especially because it fits the challenge oh so perfectly.</td>', 'I originally gave this a 6, but compared to the others I gave six, this certainly deserves more than that. I''m attracted to morning mist as well. The silhouette is working so unbelievably well in this shot. The minor ripple in the water, fantastic. Thank goodness it wasn''t placid water, I don''t think it would be as good. The desolated wintered trees in the background adds a very extra "wow" factor in this shot. So I''m changing this to a 9. It''s seriously a good shot. I hope you get a ribbon, I really do, especially because it fits the challenge oh so perfectly.', '2005-12-10 08:08:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1939925, 265817, 49102, '<td valign="top">beautiful test of photographs brought closer but one needs a minimum of clearness.</td>', 'beautiful test of photographs brought closer but one needs a minimum of clearness.', '2005-12-10 08:11:29.000000', NULL, 1),
