(1947073, 266033, 48224, '<td valign="top">I like the feel of the image...just don''t like the composition all that much. There is too much empty space around the subject and his placement in the frame is not ideal. Probably to keep it a vertical image it needed to be zoomed in more on the subject so he filled most of the frame...otherwise it could have maybe been beter to have made it horizontal with the subject at the left end of the frame. Actually, the most distracting element of the photo is the roof overhang. Since it is the lightest thing in the photo it attracts attention. Just the removal of the overhang would greatly improve things.</td>', 'I like the feel of the image...just don''t like the composition all that much. There is too much empty space around the subject and his placement in the frame is not ideal. Probably to keep it a vertical image it needed to be zoomed in more on the subject so he filled most of the frame...otherwise it could have maybe been beter to have made it horizontal with the subject at the left end of the frame. Actually, the most distracting element of the photo is the roof overhang. Since it is the lightest thing in the photo it attracts attention. Just the removal of the overhang would greatly improve things.', '2005-12-13 12:53:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947185, 265747, 29210, '<td valign="top">I love this image</td>', 'I love this image', '2005-12-13 13:30:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947186, 266174, 29210, '<td valign="top">Eerie, I could see some dead hands poking up out from the ground.</td>', 'Eerie, I could see some dead hands poking up out from the ground.', '2005-12-13 13:30:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947188, 265607, 29210, '<td valign="top">I can smell his breath from here</td>', 'I can smell his breath from here', '2005-12-13 13:31:05.000000', NULL, 1),
