(1947195, 265764, 7322, '<td valign="top">You''ve probably heard this already but this is way to small to evaluate. The subject seems to meet the challenge but I can''t really tell much else about the photo at this size. My hunch is that the ladder in the foreground should have been eliminated by approaching the shot from  slightly different angle of view--a bit more to the left. My eye is immediately drawn to it to no purpose.</td>', 'You''ve probably heard this already but this is way to small to evaluate. The subject seems to meet the challenge but I can''t really tell much else about the photo at this size. My hunch is that the ladder in the foreground should have been eliminated by approaching the shot from  slightly different angle of view--a bit more to the left. My eye is immediately drawn to it to no purpose.', '2005-12-13 13:34:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947198, 263871, 7322, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting the connection to the challenge. In terms of asthetics, the composition is good. The focus could be a bit sharper. This is just a decent snap shot to me.</td>', 'I''m not getting the connection to the challenge. In terms of asthetics, the composition is good. The focus could be a bit sharper. This is just a decent snap shot to me.', '2005-12-13 13:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947203, 265885, 29210, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2005-12-13 13:38:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947204, 266037, 29210, '<td valign="top">Wow!</td>', 'Wow!', '2005-12-13 13:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947208, 265037, 7322, '<td valign="top">The night before Christmas? I think it is a cultural thing to put gifts in shoes (boots) so I''m assuming that is what this is. It''s a pretty messy composition. The lower half of the frame is dominated by blurry vague shapes of zero interest which do nothing to lead the viewer''s eye to the main subject, the boots. The boots themselves don''t make for engaging subject matter being rather drably colored and utilitarian. The toys R us wrap in the background just adds to the visual clutter. This doesn''t look like much care was put into creating a visually pleasing image for the viewer.</td>', 'The night before Christmas? I think it is a cultural thing to put gifts in shoes (boots) so I''m assuming that is what this is. It''s a pretty messy composition. The lower half of the frame is dominated by blurry vague shapes of zero interest which do nothing to lead the viewer''s eye to the main subject, the boots. The boots themselves don''t make for engaging subject matter being rather drably colored and utilitarian. The toys R us wrap in the background just adds to the visual clutter. This doesn''t look like much care was put into creating a visually pleasing image for the viewer.', '2005-12-13 13:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947209, 265118, 29210, '<td valign="top">yeh, we are all headed there.</td>', 'yeh, we are all headed there.', '2005-12-13 13:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947219, 265493, 7322, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and good composition. I would like sharper focus, more contrast, and more color saturation in the distant trees. I''m not quite seeing a connection to the challenge--it seems foggy but not necessarily ''too early''.</td>', 'Interesting subject and good composition. I would like sharper focus, more contrast, and more color saturation in the distant trees. I''m not quite seeing a connection to the challenge--it seems foggy but not necessarily ''too early''.', '2005-12-13 13:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947241, 265922, 7322, '<td valign="top">Decent composition, although the ball should be lower in the frame to avoid the top-heavy feeling. The foucs on the ball is crisp. The red in the stitching could be much more vibrant. I''d like to see more dramatic lighting or perhaps a different colored background. Overall this fails to engage my interest in part due to the "I''ve seen this shot way to often" factor. It meets the challenge in the sense that it is too early for baseball season at the present, but viewed strictly as a photograph, without consideration of the time of year, it doesn''t convey much about earliness.</td>', 'Decent composition, although the ball should be lower in the frame to avoid the top-heavy feeling. The foucs on the ball is crisp. The red in the stitching could be much more vibrant. I''d like to see more dramatic lighting or perhaps a different colored background. Overall this fails to engage my interest in part due to the "I''ve seen this shot way to often" factor. It meets the challenge in the sense that it is too early for baseball season at the present, but viewed strictly as a photograph, without consideration of the time of year, it doesn''t convey much about earliness.', '2005-12-13 13:55:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947252, 264740, 7322, '<td valign="top">Without the title this photo doesn''t convey anything about earliness. Even with the title it''s laboring an idea that the photographer is asking the viewer to accept based soley on invention, not on what the image actually portrays. It''s an interesting composition. I like the sharp contrast and the expanse of water although this is a bit extreme. A tighter cropping would bring more focus to the bird without sacrificing the composition.  I''d like to see the rock outcropping eliminated from the frame to clean things up a bit.</td>', 'Without the title this photo doesn''t convey anything about earliness. Even with the title it''s laboring an idea that the photographer is asking the viewer to accept based soley on invention, not on what the image actually portrays. It''s an interesting composition. I like the sharp contrast and the expanse of water although this is a bit extreme. A tighter cropping would bring more focus to the bird without sacrificing the composition.  I''d like to see the rock outcropping eliminated from the frame to clean things up a bit.', '2005-12-13 13:59:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947257, 265866, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice abstract composition. I like the tension created by the tilted format. Black and white was a good choice. It''s probably stretching the theme a bit but I do get a sense of early morning light so you won''t get any real protest from me in terms of meeting the challenge.</td>', 'This is a very nice abstract composition. I like the tension created by the tilted format. Black and white was a good choice. It''s probably stretching the theme a bit but I do get a sense of early morning light so you won''t get any real protest from me in terms of meeting the challenge.', '2005-12-13 14:01:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947267, 263885, 7322, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting portrait but I don''t understand the connection to the challenge.</td>', 'This is an interesting portrait but I don''t understand the connection to the challenge.', '2005-12-13 14:05:01.000000', NULL, 1),
