(1947932, 265122, 37629, '<td valign="top">A very good shot, I love it.  It makes me feel cold and calm.  The tower in the right hand side is kind of wonky and doesnt fit the shot, However, the photo Fits the challenge. i give it a 9, i''d give it a 10 but there is always room for improvement.</td>', 'A very good shot, I love it.  It makes me feel cold and calm.  The tower in the right hand side is kind of wonky and doesnt fit the shot, However, the photo Fits the challenge. i give it a 9, i''d give it a 10 but there is always room for improvement.', '2005-12-13 17:57:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1947934, 264530, 37629, '<td valign="top">Good shot, just turn down the brightness. There isn''t really anything in the photo that tells me it''s early, for all I know he''s coming home from work. I like the shot none the less</td>', 'Good shot, just turn down the brightness. There isn''t really anything in the photo that tells me it''s early, for all I know he''s coming home from work. I like the shot none the less', '2005-12-13 17:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
