(1947940, 264697, 37629, '<td valign="top">Wow, I dont know how,  but this photo captures Early Very well, it might be the dew. Great shot.</td>', 'Wow, I dont know how,  but this photo captures Early Very well, it might be the dew. Great shot.', '2005-12-13 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
