(1955942, 265020, 30073, '<td valign="top">We were qualifying for shotgun proficiency during nighttime firearms training at the law enforcement academy I am attending. I\''m the only person that has a digital camera, therefore am the historian for our class. I was shooting photos of each student as they fired their last shot and got very lucky on this one to catch the muzzle flash. I did not use a sound trigger or other means to catch the perfect timing other anticipation and luck.<br/> <br/>This was my 2nd photo ever submitted to a challenge. Thanks for all the great comments and help I have received.</td>', 'We were qualifying for shotgun proficiency during nighttime firearms training at the law enforcement academy I am attending. I\''m the only person that has a digital camera, therefore am the historian for our class. I was shooting photos of each student as they fired their last shot and got very lucky on this one to catch the muzzle flash. I did not use a sound trigger or other means to catch the perfect timing other anticipation and luck. This was my 2nd photo ever submitted to a challenge. Thanks for all the great comments and help I have received.', '2005-12-16 09:13:53.000000', NULL, 0),
