(1961841, 265122, 32608, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Marjo:</b></div><hr/><i> Congratulations! A wonderful capture.<br/>I love that a photo with so little processing has won a ribbon.  :) </i></td></tr></table> <br/>Am I the only one that can see the rings around the sun?  I''ve recently purchased a new Sony LCD monitor and I''m seeing alot of things I haven''t in the past.  I get those rings when I over do it trying to eliminating noise with neatimage. it is an outstanding image outside of that, zorba<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-12-19 02:02:42.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Marjo: Congratulations! A wonderful capture.I love that a photo with so little processing has won a ribbon.  :)  Am I the only one that can see the rings around the sun?  I''ve recently purchased a new Sony LCD monitor and I''m seeing alot of things I haven''t in the past.  I get those rings when I over do it trying to eliminating noise with neatimage. it is an outstanding image outside of that, zorba', '2005-12-19 02:01:14.000000', '2005-12-19 02:02:42.000000', 0),
